<title>USA: J.M. Smucker sets stock repurchase program.</title>
<headline>J.M. Smucker sets stock repurchase program.</headline>
<dateline>ORRVILLE, Ohio 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>J.M. Smucker Co said its board has authorized the purchase, from time to time, of up to a total of one million of its Class A and/or Class B common shares.</p>
<p>Such purchases may be made in the open market or through block trades, it said. Some portion of the repurchased shares are expected to be reissued by the company over time in connection with employee benefit plans.</p>
<p>The Company currently has 14,423,126 Class A shares and 14,785,203 Class B shares issued and outstanding.</p>
</text>
